s1-p13 : Block
s1-p13 = prose (cons "The observation supports a proposed conclusion exactly when the requisite dependent construction is available over its compatible histories. If the reading is known to have occurred, a compatible history is also part of that information; otherwise the dependent product may be inhabited vacuously because the fiber is empty. Refining the observation can shrink the compatible fiber, so a conclusion established for every history in a coarser fiber remains established for the finer one. These are relations between specified descriptions and their evidence. The observer's state, instrument, and interpretation may themselves be included in a larger history, and the same construction then applies to them." nil)
